WEBVTT

NOTE Video ID: ldss85EOg2c

NOTE Language: en

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:07.142
… wife of a United Nations diplomat.

00:00:07.222 --> 00:00:08.562
She lives in London now

00:00:08.642 --> 00:00:10.979
but has thousands of followers around the world,

00:00:11.059 --> 00:00:13.976
who hail Her as India’s greatest living saint.

00:00:14.056 --> 00:00:17.707
She teaches a state of self-realization and happiness, and says

00:00:17.787 --> 00:00:21.265
that with a spiritual force She can cure the incurable.

00:00:21.345 --> 00:00:25.353
She’s speaking at public meetings in
Bedford tonight and Northampton tomorrow,

00:00:25.433 --> 00:00:28.473
and today She gave Her first television interview in England.

00:00:28.553 --> 00:00:30.792
Our reporter is Rebecca (inaudible) .

00:00:31.475 --> 00:00:33.684
Her Holiness Mataji Nirmala Devi

00:00:33.764 --> 00:00:36.562
is known around the world for Her healing powers.

00:00:36.642 --> 00:00:39.145
Her followers look upon Her as Divine.

00:00:39.225 --> 00:00:42.895
Mother, as She is referred to, preaches a gospel of peace

00:00:42.975 --> 00:00:46.313
and has discovered a spiritual force called Kundalini,

00:00:46.393 --> 00:00:48.353
which is shown on this chart.

00:00:48.433 --> 00:00:51.189
She can release it in seekers, as She calls them,

00:00:51.269 --> 00:00:53.729
to give them complete awareness.

00:00:53.809 --> 00:00:57.019
She admits that many Westerners are sceptical of Her powers,

00:00:57.099 --> 00:01:00.145
but She scorns the idea of charging money for Her gifts.

00:01:00.225 --> 00:01:03.770
Her claims of success in curing and healing are remarkable.

00:01:03.850 --> 00:01:06.145
Alcoholics have been known to give up drink,

00:01:06.225 --> 00:01:10.145
drug-takers have been cured, but perhaps most extraordinary of all,

00:01:10.225 --> 00:01:13.018
She claims to have cured many cancer victims.

00:01:13.098 --> 00:01:16.437
REPORTER: How many people have you
managed to cure who have had cancer?

00:01:16.517 --> 00:01:18.690
SHRI MATAJI: Thousands… I don’t know… I should say…

00:01:18.770 --> 00:01:23.080
REPORTER: Thousands? What do doctors think of what you’re saying?

00:01:23.160 --> 00:01:28.947
SHRI MATAJI: You see the trouble is I Myself
I have done medicine and the doctors are the people

00:01:29.027 --> 00:01:31.687
who are working with the “shoot” side of life, you see,

00:01:31.767 --> 00:01:33.395
not the “roots” of it.

00:01:33.475 --> 00:01:38.186
So the trouble with them is that
anybody starts talking that it can be cured

00:01:38.266 --> 00:01:42.100
by a higher method than a human awareness,

00:01:42.180 --> 00:01:44.572
then they don’t want to jump into that awareness,

00:01:44.652 --> 00:01:47.605
which is a higher awareness that one has to achieve,

00:01:47.685 --> 00:01:50.353
because human awareness is still transitory.

00:01:50.433 --> 00:01:53.603
You have to achieve that awareness which is the divine awareness.

00:01:53.683 --> 00:01:56.768
When you have that awareness, then only you can cure it.

00:01:56.848 --> 00:02:01.601
REPORTER: How would You describe
yourself, as a healer or a spiritualist?

00:02:01.681 --> 00:02:08.989
SHRI MATAJI: You see, I do not want to fall
into any category Myself because… I’m a housewife

00:02:09.069 --> 00:02:11.734
and I have to do all the jobs of a housewife,

00:02:11.814 --> 00:02:15.982
I’m also a diplomat’s wife, so I have to act as a diplomat’s wife,

00:02:16.062 --> 00:02:22.395
I’m also a person who has to do this work of Sahaja Yoga…

00:02:22.475 --> 00:02:25.184
So I don’t know how to describe Myself.

00:02:25.264 --> 00:02:27.442
REPORTER: Can I ask You if You can reach me?

00:02:27.522 --> 00:02:29.897
SHRI MATAJI: Yes yes, see, one can reach masses.

00:02:29.977 --> 00:02:34.645
Now, we have to first see in your case now what is the problem.

00:02:34.725 --> 00:02:37.729
First is that there’s an imbalance, a little imbalance,

00:02:37.809 --> 00:02:42.437
because you have to work outside too much,
I think, you have to go out too much

00:02:42.517 --> 00:02:45.309
and don’t have much time for your emotional life.

00:02:45.389 --> 00:02:48.972
So it’s more that you are more mental and physical,

00:02:49.052 --> 00:02:52.563
but less of emotions in you, so there has to be a balance.

00:02:52.643 --> 00:02:56.186
So first I have to give a balance like this, all right?

00:02:56.266 --> 00:02:58.437
I have to put you into balance now.

00:02:58.517 --> 00:03:01.937
Now, this is, you are working with your mind too much,

00:03:02.017 --> 00:03:05.895
so you are over-working it, so your liver is out.

00:03:05.975 --> 00:03:08.559
And the liver is also excited.

00:03:08.639 --> 00:03:13.850
So to put it right what we have to do is to just put you…

00:03:13.930 --> 00:03:15.645
REPORTER: What are you doing?

00:03:15.725 --> 00:03:18.111
SHRI MATAJI: Just I’m removing the liver pressure.

00:03:18.191 --> 00:03:22.353
The liver is expressed in this part and this part of the hand.

00:03:22.433 --> 00:03:26.103
So your liver pressure is reduced. It’s very simple.

00:03:26.183 --> 00:03:30.060
REPORTER: Now, is anyone watching this
going to have, feel any effect from You?

00:03:30.140 --> 00:03:33.770
SHRI MATAJI: From Me? REP: Yes.
SHRI MATAJI: No no, no effect. No, nothing.

00:03:33.850 --> 00:03:37.979
Because it is just, you see, it’s
like construction of the destruction;

00:03:38.059 --> 00:03:41.772
you just take out the destruction
out of the construction, that’s all.

00:03:41.852 --> 00:03:45.061
It’s very simple. Now, what I am doing now.

00:03:45.141 --> 00:03:48.979
You have to now just say within
yourself — or loudly if you want to —

00:03:49.059 --> 00:03:53.643
say that “Mother, I forgive everyone.” Just say that.

00:03:53.723 --> 00:03:55.142
REP.: Mother, I forgive everyone.

00:03:55.222 --> 00:03:57.854
SHRI MATAJI: Yes, you have to say thrice. Now let’s see. Say it.

00:03:57.934 --> 00:04:00.145
REP: Mother, I forgive everyone. SHRI MATAJI: Again.

00:04:00.225 --> 00:04:02.395
REP: Mother, I forgive everyone. SHRI MATAJI: Again.

00:04:02.475 --> 00:04:04.395
REP: Mother, I forgive everyone.

00:04:04.475 --> 00:04:10.854
SHRI MATAJI: Now see. Is it flowing? Rep.: A little bit.

00:04:10.934 --> 00:04:14.475
SHRI MATAJI: It’s very sensitive, it’s very subtle.

00:04:15.955 --> 00:04:19.434
REPORTER: Well, I can… I can feel the clearness of it. Yes.

00:04:19.514 --> 00:04:22.125
SHRI MATAJI: It’s started. Started, see?

00:04:22.205 --> 00:04:24.991
Just what I’m making, a cross on your hand.

00:04:25.071 --> 00:04:28.228
You see, that’s Christ, who said you have to forgive.

00:04:28.308 --> 00:04:30.601
Now see. It’s working?

00:04:30.681 --> 00:04:33.147
REPORTER: And what will it do for me in the long run?

00:04:33.227 --> 00:04:34.920
SHRI MATAJI: In the long run.

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:39.119
That it is your own power now will manifest.
You have this power within yourself.

00:04:39.199 --> 00:04:41.937
Now with this, you will feel very peaceful,

00:04:42.017 --> 00:04:46.077
you will control your thoughts.
You don`t have to think all the time.

00:04:46.157 --> 00:04:50.355
You can rest without thinking. If you want,
you can think, otherwise you need not think.

00:04:50.435 --> 00:04:54.437
Then your own powers will be manifested,
by which you can give this power to others.

00:04:54.517 --> 00:04:56.440
There’s so many things you can do.